SUMMARY:Sad Girlz
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:While preparing for an upcoming swimming trip to Brazil\, best 
 friends La Maestra and Paula see their bright futures upended one fateful 
 night. First-time feature director Fernanda Tovar crafts a moving coming-o
 f-age drama in this Berlinale award winner.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/sad-
 girlz\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/sad-girlz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d3c0ae3e181c62737489aa41a18e3ae3ccf1afa1@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261011T010050Z
DTSTART:20261010T223000Z
DTEND:20261011T003000Z
SUMMARY:Minotaur
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Andrey Zvyagintsev’s first feature in a decade\, this chillin
 g reimagining of La femme infidèle and Unfaithful masterfully explores th
 e depths of corruption in Vladimir Putin’s Russia through a story of cri
 me and infidelity.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/minotaur\nFrom Pushpin Bay Ar
 ea: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/minotaur
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
