DTSTAMP:20261011T010050Z
DTSTART:20261011T020000Z
DTEND:20261011T040000Z
SUMMARY:On Behalf of My Son
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:After losing her son in a tragic accident\, a mother travels fr
 om one family to another carrying an apology that may be impossible to acc
 ept\, in Gabriel Martins’s delicate\, deeply human meditation on grief a
 nd forgiveness.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/behalf-my-son\nFrom Pushpin Bay 
 Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/behalf-my-son
END:VEVENT
