SUMMARY:Jean-Luc Godard's Early Short Films
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:A glimpse of Jean-Luc Godard in the process of becoming Godard.
  This program of the director’s first shorts includes Opération béton\
 , All the Boys Are Called Patrick\, Une histoire d’eau\, and Charlotte e
 t son Jules.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/jean-luc-godards-early-short-films\
 nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/jean-luc-godards-early-short-films
