SUMMARY:Remembering Harun Farocki
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:This is a new restoration of Claudia von Alemann and Reinold E.
  Thiel’s documentary on the legendary experimental film festival of Knok
 ke\, Belgium\, featuring political filmmaker Harun Farocki in action. Show
 n with three short films by Farocki\, including Inextinguishable Fire.\nht
 tps://bampfa.org/event/remembering-harun-farocki\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: h
 ttps://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/remembering-harun-farocki
