SUMMARY:Marjorie Keller Films
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:The late Marjorie Keller’s films ranged from social and polit
 ical critiques to intimate portraits of people who populated her world. He
 r intricate visual and sound editing is pointed while also being poeticall
 y suggestive. On the occasion of a new book about Keller’s films\, contr
 ibutor Steve Anker presents five of her films.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/m
 arjorie-keller-films\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/marjorie-keller-films
